                <pb facs="0759" n="677" sameAs="frus:frus1911/pg677"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 819.415A/A.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The President of the United
                            States to the President of
                    Panama.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >The White House</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1911-11-03"><hi rendition="#italic">November 3,
                        1911</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>I beg Your Excellency to accept my cordial felicitations on this national
                    anniversary of the Republic of Panama and assurances of the good will which this
                    Government and people have for your country.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Wm. H. Taft.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
